       - the decision guard accepting any historic approval row, noting the comment in the committed 20261018 migration is inaccurate;
       - the INSERT gap in that guard;
       - the known-device residuals;
       - the change-password burst TOCTOU;
       - R-4 rotation window, and CLIENT_IP_HEADER not required in production;
       - R-5 truncated claims that may have no eligible approver in small tenants;
